//! Native replacements for the host imports Vantage calls. Generated by `tools/emit_host.py`; the
//! signatures are the ones `mod-api` generates for the `handled-player-mod` world.
//!
//! In the WebAssembly build each function calls the real import. In a native build it calls the
//! installed [`Host`]; with none installed, or for a function the client has not implemented, it
//! answers like a host that refuses the request.

